Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.66,0:00:05.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like there are some good ones around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.50,0:00:06.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.08,0:00:15.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-kun, you sure did something quite drastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.03,0:00:18.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,You two gave Yaeno-kun that mark,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.19,0:00:23.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,the mark of a friend who will protect the secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.10,0:00:27.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,That mark can be given to only one person, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.71,0:00:30.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,If it happens again... {HA: If it were to happen again... || If it happens again...}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.82,0:02:24.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo, how's this look? {HA: how's this look?}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.60,0:02:27.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,It looks really good, Nako-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.07,0:02:30.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,Yep, just keep on going like that, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.89,0:02:32.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,But compared to that...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.40,0:02:41.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,You must have never done this before, right Tsuwabuki-kun? {HA: right, Tsuwabuki-kun?}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.28,0:02:43.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tswuabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.94,0:02:46.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,Akihime-san, please teach him how.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.53,0:02:47.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.49,0:02:50.43,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,I think you can just show him the step-by-step method. {I think you can jsut show him step-by-step}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.70,0:02:55.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.23,0:02:57.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,You do this...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.05,0:02:59.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,then this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.54,0:03:03.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Then this... and then like this... and...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.55,0:03:06.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,And here! It's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.25,0:03:09.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, that looks good.{Ah, good job.}{\t(\hat looks good)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.39,0:03:12.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,This will be this year's main decoration. {\check, must be main of something}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.48,0:03:13.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,We'll name it the Wishing Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.43,0:03:16.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,Wishing Star?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.06,0:03:19.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,On July 7th, if you make a wish to this golden Wishing Star, your wish will definitely come true. {HA: On July 7th,} {HA: your wish/the wish}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.84,0:03:22.32,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,It's decided. It'll be that.{Let's decide it to be that.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.86,0:03:24.11,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! {HA: Okay!}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.85,0:03:35.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tswuabuki,0000,0000,0000,,The sun is setting...{It's setting down...} {HA: The sun is setting...}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.40,0:03:40.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Alright...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.00,0:03:49.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Is the star drop going to fall down today too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.33,0:03:51.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.33,0:03:55.18,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,You have a smile on your face... {HA: your face...}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.30,0:03:57.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? Yeah! {HA: Eh? Yeah!}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:03:58.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I've been thinking...{HA: ...}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.67,0:04:01.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,What should I wish for?{what should I wish to the wishing star.}{HA: What should i wish for?}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.61,0:04:06.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Something like, "I wish to be a kinder person," or... {HA: Something like... "I wish to be a kinder person" or...}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.98,0:04:09.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,"I wish to have more courage." {HA: I wish to have more courage".}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.54,0:04:14.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Or even something like, "I wish to have bigger breasts." {HA: Or even like, "I wish to have bigger breasts"}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.80,0:04:15.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.49,0:04:21.41,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I hope tomorrow will be sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.64,0:04:24.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Since it will be Tanabata.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.33,0:04:27.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,It's shining!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.42,0:04:29.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,It's here, the star drop! {HA: The star drop is here!}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.37,0:04:30.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go, Yuki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.44,0:04:38.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,It went into the planetarium.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.00,0:04:41.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Err, are we able to get inside that building?{Err, can we go inside the building?} {HA: Err, are we allowed in that building?}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.86,0:04:49.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,I don't see any opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.25,0:04:52.19,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,But we need to do something and get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.33,0:04:54.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.29,0:05:05.19,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Umm... 'puro'... 'gu'...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.56,0:05:07.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,and also 'ridia'.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.10,0:05:12.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs28\fnCalligraph421 BT\3c&H985443&}Puro Guridia!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.09,0:05:20.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,T-This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.46,0:05:24.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,...a way in, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.31,0:05:38.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.35,0:05:45.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,It's so dark, Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.71,0:05:52.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,The two drops before this were shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.58,0:05:54.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Are you alright, Sumomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.73,0:05:56.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,How about we just give up for today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.42,0:05:59.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I'm alright since I'm with you, Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.53,0:06:00.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.50,0:06:02.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Well, this is for Yuki-chan's sake after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.92,0:06:04.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.33,0:06:05.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.04,0:06:08.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.80,0:06:12.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,The star drop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.16,0:06:17.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Alright, I'll try to catch it, Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.09,0:06:22.19,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs28\fnCalligraph421 BT\3c&H985443&}Puruvu Ra-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.65,0:06:37.69,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of clothes are those?{What kind of clothes is that?}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.95,0:06:41.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,And you call{HA: And you call} yourself a Stellar Spinear?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.17,0:06:49.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,W-Who the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.35,0:07:06.16,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,Nice to meet you, Prima Plam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.53,0:07:09.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,What? Prima...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.90,0:07:10.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,...Plam?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.09,0:07:21.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,I am the Saint Aspalas' Stellar Spinear, Prima Aspalas!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.33,0:07:26.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Prima... Aspalas?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.00,0:07:27.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Wow,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.29,0:07:28.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,that's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.88,0:07:31.20,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,Don't joke with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.20,0:07:33.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,We are enemies, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.57,0:07:35.43,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,Rivals in gathering the star drops!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.83,0:07:37.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,She said enemy, do you know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.80,0:07:38.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.78,0:07:42.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,Is that doll your servant?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.42,0:07:44.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,Is it even competent?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.53,0:07:50.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs28\fnCalligraph421 BT\3c&H436398&}Di Pieroto. {\list here what you hear: HA: Ti Pierreoto}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.83,0:07:51.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.88,0:07:53.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.97,0:08:00.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,What a strange little...{something}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.54,0:08:02.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan...!{Give me back...}{aiko: Isn't she saying Yuki-chan?}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.57,0:08:04.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.40,0:08:06.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Give me back Yuki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.05,0:08:12.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Are you alright, Yuki-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.42,0:08:13.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.03,0:08:16.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, what was that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.64,0:08:18.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,Are you making fun of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.86,0:08:21.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.10,0:08:23.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,What you said about Prima...{HA: What was that about Prima...?}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.67,0:08:24.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,It's Prima Plam!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.13,0:08:25.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Is that... {HA: Is that..}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.22,0:08:27.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,really me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.25,0:08:30.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,You have the Ladle and your servant...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.78,0:08:33.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,There is no way I'm wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.80,0:08:40.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs28\fnCalligraph421 BT\3c&H436398&}Ruuche Ruvi Avis! {list here what you hear HA: Ruuchin (R/D)ubi, A(v/b)is}{'Puruce Rubi, Avis'}{list here what you hear HA: Ruuchin (R/D)ubi, A(v/b)is}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.04,0:08:52.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.68,0:09:00.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs28\fnCalligraph421 BT\3c&H436398&}Puruvi Radius! {list here what you hear}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.63,0:09:08.08,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.42,0:09:11.11,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,She captured the star drop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.88,0:09:13.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],Arthur,0000,0000,0000,,Congratulations...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.49,0:09:14.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],Arthur,0000,0000,0000,,...Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.82,0:09:16.61,Nanatsuiro[Default],Arthur,0000,0000,0000,,This will be the third star drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.33,0:09:18.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Third?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.89,0:09:20.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,The dog talked!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.56,0:09:23.22,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,You're able to do so too, right?{You are sheep too, aren't you.}{HA: You're able to, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.49,0:09:25.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,And you're a doll on top of that.{And a doll on top of that.}{HA: You're a doll on top of that.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.67,0:09:28.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,Arthur, bring that here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.66,0:09:31.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],Arthur,0000,0000,0000,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.35,0:09:33.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,No, not the lunch box!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.39,0:09:34.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],Arthur,0000,0000,0000,,I am really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.46,0:09:36.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],Arthur,0000,0000,0000,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.83,0:09:39.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],Arthur,0000,0000,0000,,What do I need a mop for? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.21,0:09:41.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],Arthur,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.56,0:09:43.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],Arthur,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's wrong! Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.69,0:09:45.03,Nanatsuiro[Default2],Arthur,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, sorry! {dog line}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.74,0:09:49.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],Arthur,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really sorry! How about this?{dog's line}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.71,0:09:47.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?! I mean that, that thing! Don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.74,0:09:46.88,Nanatsuiro[Default2],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.74,0:09:49.11,Nanatsuiro[Default2],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,These two...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.61,0:09:51.28,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,That's right, it's this one. {HA: You've got the right one.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.21,0:09:54.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,Bring that to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.63,0:10:01.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,This book looks similar to Yuki-chan's book.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.51,0:10:04.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,Open the pages please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.82,0:10:09.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me your magical power is only that much? {HA: Your magical power is that low?}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.09,0:10:11.34,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to be so mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.34,0:10:13.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,Being mean? You must be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.77,0:10:15.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, this is a fight, you know. {contest}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.72,0:10:17.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,A fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.03,0:10:21.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. I want a fair fight in gathering the star drops...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.85,0:10:25.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,with someone whose power corresponds to mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.14,0:10:29.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,But since you can't even open my Recipe, {HA: err...recipe?}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.33,0:10:32.91,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,that means your level is much lower compared to mine. {HA: lower than mine.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.17,0:10:36.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,You... Are you really the Prima Plam?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.48,0:10:38.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.71,0:10:42.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you don't know about it... {HA: Even though you don't know much,}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.65,0:10:45.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,...you are still destined to fight with me. {HA: you are still destined to fight with me.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.21,0:10:46.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,Improve on your skills. {HA: Improve your skills.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.81,0:10:50.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,If you want to gather the star drops, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.34,0:10:54.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,You won't be getting any of the star drops from me! {HA: check - She hasnt gotten any from her yet.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.38,0:10:57.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.59,0:10:59.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.43,0:11:01.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.73,0:11:19.32,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.32,0:11:20.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.28,0:11:27.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,If you feel sick, how about letting me handle giving out the bamboo decorations at the park? {HA: If you feel sick, how about letting me give out the bamboo decoration at the park?}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.03,0:11:29.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm alright, Nako-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.74,0:11:31.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Look, I'm healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.64,0:11:33.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I'm alright, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.70,0:11:36.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I can hand out the bamboo decorations.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.23,0:11:38.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.72,0:11:42.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tswuabuki,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Akihime...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.67,0:11:49.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.17,0:11:51.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Cheer up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.10,0:11:54.18,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.18,0:11:58.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn't able to catch the star drop...{HA: wasn't}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.13,0:12:00.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, there is always next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.93,0:12:03.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.33,0:12:04.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.80,0:12:05.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry... {HA: Sorry...}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.98,0:12:12.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tswuabuki,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Akihime...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.12,0:12:17.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tswuabuki,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}In any case, we have to stop that other girl. {check}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.79,0:12:19.32,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:22.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,Another Stellar Spinear appeared. {HA: has appeared}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.17,0:12:24.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tswuabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Stop deploring and explain about it. {HA: deploring is a difficult word for some people, and i cant think of something to replace it with :P}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.61,0:12:30.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,But this doesn't always mean it's bad news. Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.35,0:12:31.22,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tswuabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.24,0:12:35.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,For now, I can only say 'maybe'. {HA: At this time, i can only say 'maybe'.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.78,0:12:37.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tswuabuki,0000,0000,0000,,What's with that answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.45,0:12:42.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tswuabuki,0000,0000,0000,,It's not fair for Akihime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.54,0:12:44.79,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tswuabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Even last night she was...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.44,0:12:50.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,I see. So Akihime-san did... {hint hint cough cough} {HA: I see...}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.14,0:12:53.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tswuabuki,0000,0000,0000,,W-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.11,0:12:54.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.57,0:12:58.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, we have to go to the park today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.66,0:13:04.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.30,0:13:07.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Onee-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.39,0:13:10.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,This decoration here is called the Wishing Star.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.70,0:13:11.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Wishing Star?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.13,0:13:15.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. If you make a wish to this star,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.17,0:13:16.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,your wish will definitely come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.91,0:13:18.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.93,0:13:27.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, I'm going to help walk these kids home. {HA: Well then, I'm going to take(escort?) these kids home.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.94,0:13:29.79,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Onee-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.79,0:13:31.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.77,0:13:34.32,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I hope your wish comes true. {HA: comes true}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.32,0:13:35.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.60,0:13:52.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tswuabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Akihime...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.80,0:14:03.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I have to cheer up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.57,0:14:15.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,From now on I will keep doing my best for Yuki-chan's sake. {HA: From now on, I will do my best for Yuki-chan's sake.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.88,0:14:17.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,For Yuki-chan's sake! {HA: For Yuki-chan's sake!}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:35.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tswuabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Akihime.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.01,0:14:38.22,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.54,0:14:41.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tswuabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like you guys are done. {allready done.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.00,0:14:44.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tswuabuki,0000,0000,0000,,I hurried here from Kisaragi-sensei's room. {HA: I hurried here}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.08,0:14:49.11,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, did you hear everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.11,0:14:50.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.74,0:14:52.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tswuabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. {supposed to be a 'yes' before this line.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.83,0:14:56.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tswuabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.45,0:15:00.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tswuabuki,0000,0000,0000,,A-Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.77,0:15:07.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Because today, Akihime was different than usual. {HA: Because, you were acting different today.}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.18,0:15:10.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.66,0:15:13.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,T-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.91,0:15:19.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Umm I... I was just feeling kind of down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.12,0:15:22.08,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,A lot of things happened. {HA: A lot of stuff/things happened.}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.24,0:15:24.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.46,0:15:31.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,But tonight will be Tanabata, so... {HA: But... tonight is Tanabata, so}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.68,0:15:37.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,When I think about the people who will make their wishes to the Wishing Star, {HA: who will wish to the wishing star,}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.83,0:15:41.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I feel better. {HA: I feel better.}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.16,0:15:43.44,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Is that strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.90,0:15:45.19,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.55,0:15:55.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,That's right, we need to clean up. {HA: Oh yeah, we need to clean up.}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.40,0:15:57.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,{hmmmm}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.22,0:16:01.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,You know what? {HA: You know what?}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.11,0:16:04.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe I'm being nosy, but... {HA: It might seem nosy, but}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.37,0:16:12.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Doing something for someone else's sake or something like that... {HA: doing something for someone else's sake, or the like...}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.38,0:16:17.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't have to worry about those things so much.{I think you don't have to worry about those much.} {HA: You shouldn't/needn't have to worry about those things.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:20.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Because doing that will make you suffer, Akihime.{That is what will make you suffer, Akihime...} {HA: Because doing that will make you suffer, Akihime.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.11,0:16:22.43,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.02,0:16:25.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Even for that person called Yuki-chan... {HA: "Yuki-chan" as well...}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.00,0:16:27.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,...he wouldn't be happy seeing you suffer. {HA: suffer.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.32,0:16:37.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.62,0:16:42.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do so Yuki-chan will be happy? {HA: What should i do so that Yuki-chan is/stays happy?}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.27,0:16:46.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,I can't say it any better, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.69,0:16:52.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Just be yourself. I think that is enough. {HA: Just be yourself. That should do it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.59,0:16:53.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.91,0:17:08.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],Father,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo-chan, welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.78,0:17:10.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.94,0:17:12.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],Father,0000,0000,0000,,Perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.51,0:17:15.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],Father,0000,0000,0000,,I forgot something important at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.30,0:17:17.44,Nanatsuiro[Default],Father,0000,0000,0000,,So can I leave you to watch the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.54,0:17:18.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:19.18,Nanatsuiro[Default],Father,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.64,0:17:23.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],Father,0000,0000,0000,,I'll come home as soon as I can, but I'll call if I'm going to be late. {HA: I'll come home as soon as i can, but I'll call if I'm going to be late.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.75,0:17:25.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.02,0:17:28.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],Father,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah, I prepared dinner, but... {HA: Oh yeah, I prepared dinner, but}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.77,0:17:33.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],Father,0000,0000,0000,,if it's a problem, you can eat leftover curry in the refrigerator. {HA: if it's a problem, you can eat the leftover curry in the fridge.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.99,0:17:35.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Got it! {HA: Got it!}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.47,0:17:36.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],Father,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.12,0:17:38.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,See ya later!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.42,0:17:42.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Watching the house, huh? {HA: Watch the house, eh?}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.79,0:17:45.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.63,0:17:47.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Good for you, Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.56,0:17:49.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,We can somehow see the Milky Way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.29,0:17:57.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,The kids who got the bamboo decorations must be happy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.34,0:17:58.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.01,0:18:01.39,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.39,0:18:03.11,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.20,0:18:06.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, actually I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.98,0:18:09.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,was thinking a lot today. {HA: did alot of thinking today.}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.86,0:18:17.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,From now on, that girl from yesterday will probably...{HA: From now on, the girl from yesterday will probobly take all}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.91,0:18:19.91,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,...take all of the star drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.91,0:18:21.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.40,0:18:25.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I probably won't be... {HA: I probobly won't be...}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.53,0:18:28.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,any use to Yuki-chan anymore. {HA: Yuki-chan}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.92,0:18:31.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,That's what I thought about. {HA: That's what i thought about.}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.24,0:18:33.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.47,0:18:34.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.71,0:18:36.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.24,0:18:39.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I searched for what I could do. {HA: I searched for what i could do.}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.53,0:18:46.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Something that even {\i1}I {\i0}can do, for Yuki-chan's sake. {HA: Yuki-chan's sake.}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.00,0:18:50.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I will always be there with a smile...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.35,0:18:56.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Because that is the only thing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.54,0:18:57.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.38,0:19:08.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Eh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.04,0:19:15.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I'm... sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.36,0:19:20.16,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I... can't seem to smile...{I can't smile normally...} {other words?} {HA: I can't normally smile ?}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.85,0:19:23.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.51,0:19:26.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.27,0:19:33.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Star-sama{HA: O-star? Oh, star,?}, please let me smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.64,0:19:41.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.89,0:19:48.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo, Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.61,0:19:51.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Open your eyes, slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.72,0:20:03.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan, this is...{HA:...}?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.08,0:20:07.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo, your wishes will come true! {HA: your wishes will come true!}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.16,0:20:12.23,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.59,0:20:14.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan, Yuki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.09,0:20:16.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Yuki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.16,0:20:18.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.78,0:20:22.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. {HA: Oh yeah!}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.12,0:20:25.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I was thinking of a present for you.{I'm thinking to give you a present.}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.53,0:20:28.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,A present?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.52,0:20:33.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Last night the spell by Aspalas-san was really beautiful, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.75,0:20:37.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I could see it again with Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.76,0:20:38.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.35,0:20:40.72,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.90,0:20:51.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Please, golden Wishing Star... {HA: Please, Oh golden wishing star...}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.67,0:20:54.20,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I want to show this to Yuki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.46,0:21:00.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs28\fnCalligraph421 BT\3c&H985443&}Ruuche Ruvi Avis!{'Puruce Rubi Avis'}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.32,0:21:18.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.17,0:21:21.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,You did it, Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.96,0:21:23.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.30,0:21:25.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,That's amazing, Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.00,0:21:27.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks to you, Yuki-chan. {HA: Thanks to you, Yuki-chan.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.21,0:21:28.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.47,0:21:30.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.97,0:21:32.11,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.48,0:21:34.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,...Tsuwabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.47,0:21:40.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],Arthur,0000,0000,0000,,This can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.12,0:21:42.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.86,0:21:47.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,She mastered the "Sakuya Shirimoshinakata"{some skill name... I have no idea what this is, need confirmation} skill in one night? {HA: She mastered the Sakuya(sakura?) Shirimoshinakata in one night?}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.16,0:21:48.69,Nanatsuiro[Default],Arthur,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.69,0:21:53.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],Arthur,0000,0000,0000,,{It looks so beautiful I can't help staring at it.}It looked so beautiful, I couldn't help but stare at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.53,0:21:55.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,I never asked your opinion!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.71,0:21:57.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],Arthur,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.25,0:21:58.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],Arthur,0000,0000,0000,,Please forgive me!{I am really sorry!}{Please forgive me} {HA: Please forgive me is better}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.92,0:22:03.08,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,Just as I thought, that girl is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.88,0:22:09.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The day after the unforgettable Tanabata evening...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.20,0:22:11.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,Alright everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.57,0:22:13.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,Be quiet please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.47,0:22:18.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,Just for today I will be your homeroom teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.46,0:22:23.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,First off, an introduction of a new transfer student. {HA: First off, an introduction of a new transfer student.}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.04,0:22:27.18,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Transferring at this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.43,0:22:36.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],Boys,0000,0000,0000,,A beautiful girl with glasses!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.89,0:22:38.43,Nanatsuiro[Default],Boys,0000,0000,0000,,A very high grade! {whats that garble stuff, check}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.43,0:22:40.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],Some Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Hey boys! Don't stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.01,0:22:43.34,Nanatsuiro[Default],Aspalas,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Yuuki Nona.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.73,0:22:49.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That was the dawn of the troubles ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.28,0:24:21.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,It's here, it's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.54,0:24:22.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],Girls,0000,0000,0000,,What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.51,0:24:23.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,The summer is!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.31,0:24:24.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],Girls,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, summer boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.73,0:24:26.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,It's summer! It's the pool! It's swimming!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.48,0:24:28.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],Girls,0000,0000,0000,,Speaking of swimming, that's Tsuwabuki-kun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.49,0:24:30.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],Girls,0000,0000,0000,,He's a completely different person once in the water. {HA: He's a completely different person once in the water.}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.68,0:24:32.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],Girls,0000,0000,0000,,I want to be consoled too. {check}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.81,0:24:34.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yuki-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Just like Sumomo-chan?
